{"unit_id":"xichen-62__dsh-power-menu#caveat-route-doc","repo":"xichen-62/dsh-power-menu","commit":"425a44e5d4c6cd3972b384b7ebcc3c3fad709aea","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-power-menu 使用前须知：README 的接口清单没有列出只读 GET /plan 路由；该路由在实现中用于查看目标状态，不执行关闭或重启。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:206-222"]}
